<%# Port of the legacy SPA `Hujah/card_small.js` as used on the profile — a compact
    card for one of the user's hoojahs, left border colored by the poster's stance,
    linking through to the full hoojah. Locals: hujah.

    DESIGN SYSTEM (Slice 9, Task 4.4) — this is `hujahs/_child_card` wearing a profile
    hat, so it gets the same three corrections Task 4.3 made there, for the same
    reasons. Keep the two in step; a reader who diffs them should see only the
    response-filter data attributes and the challenge row, which are the thread's
    business and not the profile's.

    1. The 8px stance border comes from `ui/_card`'s `stance:` instead of being
       interpolated into `border-<...>` here. `ds_card_classes` raises on a value
       outside CARD_STANCES; raw interpolation of a typo yields a class with no rule
       behind it and renders as a card that merely looks unstanced, which neither
       review nor CI sees. The `|| "primary"` fallback for an unvoted hoojah is in the
       set for exactly that reason.
    2. The avatar goes through `ui/_avatar` at `sm` (32px, the design system's
       compact-card box). `image_tag user.photo` raises on a blank photo, and this
       renders once per hoojah on a profile.
    3. The `@handle` says `text-sm` outright. A bare `<small>` is 0.8em — 12.8px
       against the body's 16px — and the design system's UI text is 14px.

    `padded:` stays unset (the inner row owns its padding) and `pr-2 flex items-center
    mb-1` rides in `class:`; 4px between compact cards, not the feed's 8px. %>
<% stance = {1 => "agree", 2 => "neutral", 3 => "disagree"}[hujah.vote] || "primary" %>
<%= link_to hujah_path(hujah.slug), class: "block no-underline" do %>
  <%= render layout: "ui/card",
        locals: {stance: stance, class: "pr-2 flex items-center mb-1"} do %>
    <div class="flex py-1">
      <%= render "ui/avatar", user: hujah.user, size: :sm, class: "mx-2" %>
      <div class="flex flex-col min-w-0">
        <div>
          <span class="mr-1 text-primary"><%= hujah.user.full_name %></span>
          <small class="text-sm text-grey">@<%= hujah.user.username %></small>
        </div>
        <div class="mb-0 text-black break-words"><%= format_body(hujah.body) %></div>
        <%# Secret ballot (2a/A7): below k=5 total votes the per-stance split is a
            de-anonymization vector — replaced by the total-only label. %>
        <div class="flex items-center text-sm text-light-grey">
          <% if hujah.breakdown_visible? %>
            <%= stance_icon("agree", class: "w-4 h-4") %><span class="ml-1"><%= hujah.agree_count.to_i %></span>
            <span class="mx-2">·</span>
            <%= stance_icon("neutral", class: "w-4 h-4") %><span class="ml-1"><%= hujah.neutral_count.to_i %></span>
            <span class="mx-2">·</span>
            <%= stance_icon("disagree", class: "w-4 h-4") %><span class="ml-1"><%= hujah.disagree_count.to_i %></span>
          <% else %>
            <span><%= vote_total_label(hujah) %></span>
          <% end %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
